From 5bc094bd639b3982c6f68e92256a943ffc6d8e5f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christopher Owen <root@your.mom>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 12:16:09 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Stream ring relay chunks with independent epoch readiness

Base: f8069b2 plus the balanced TP4 and diagnostic patch series. Retains full-fragment GPU flags and the two-slot lifetime. Chunk flags use reserved flag-line words, RC write ordering, and the existing device-to-CPU barrier. Changes transfer timing only, preserving reduction order. Opt-in experiment, not proposed for upstream or production yet. ASAN/UBSAN protocol simulations pass 32000 collectives including delayed DMA, wrap, mismatched chunk geometry, stop, and partial readiness in both directions; hardware screen pending.
